_:N5628ed0e0e1a4a16861bf21f241531c8 a csvw:Column ;
    dct:description """Code list
Format is "1 = Chocolate | 2 = Strawberry | 3 = Vanilla".
The Pipe character is required between codes because line breaks will be lost if the data dictionary (CSV) is used to update this field.""" ;
    dct:isPartOf "code_list" ;
    dct:type "notes" ;
    csvw:datatype "string" ;
    csvw:name "code_list" ;
    csvw:title """Code list
Format is "1 = Chocolate | 2 = Strawberry | 3 = Vanilla".
The Pipe character is required between codes because line breaks will be lost if the data dictionary (CSV) is used to update this field.""" .

